      "act": "NEXT STEPS",
      "role_note": "HANDOFF LAW",
      "narration_text": "Your turn. Pick a field in a pipeline you rely on, and check what it actually returns when the value is missing — not what you assume it returns. The gap between those two answers is exactly where schema drift hides.",
